1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,947
The outside pressure came from the hospital itself.

2
00:00:02,947 --> 00:00:20,028
A medical committee, a doctor of public health, and a corps of athletic trainers proposed a fast, tough piece of legislation: every club must report its injuries, its treatment, and the prevalence of disease among its members.

3
00:00:20,028 --> 00:00:24,273
“My game is not your game,” the coach said.

4
00:00:24,273 --> 00:00:27,787
“But the matter is the same.”

5
00:00:27,787 --> 00:00:38,965
The requirement was to be vigorous and orderly: a pillar of the new regime, a topical digest of every seizure, a bodily audit of every waist.

6
00:00:38,965 --> 00:00:44,488
“We can tolerate a fever and a sweater,” the physiotherapist said.

7
00:00:44,488 --> 00:00:54,466
“We cannot tolerate starvation in a healthy athlete.” The abolition of the old exemptions was pushed through in a month.

8
00:00:54,466 --> 00:00:57,691
The vital statistics were alarming.

9
00:00:57,691 --> 00:01:09,903
A pregnant player, an influenza outbreak, and a muscular injury that would need surgery made the case for refrigeration, flour, and a competence in the kitchen.

10
00:01:09,903 --> 00:01:14,167
“You must absorb the fact,” the doctor said.

11
00:01:14,167 --> 00:01:18,312
“Strength is not the same as health.”

12
00:01:18,312 --> 00:01:28,015
The invasive part was the prescription: a healthful diet, a fast walk, and an hour of treatment that nobody could date.

13
00:01:28,015 --> 00:01:33,159
“You push a pillar and the pillar pushes back,” the committee said.

14
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:45,696
“That is why we legislate today rather than yesterday.” The deprivation of rest, they added, is an extremity no club should be allowed to reach.

15
00:01:45,696 --> 00:01:56,909
The pressure came from the country as well: a national register, a march of monthly figures, and a used-up phrase about “the healthy majority”.

16
00:01:56,909 --> 00:02:09,196
My answer was simple, the coach said: an attempt to measure the muscle and not the person is likely to fail, and it must fail before the committee meets again in the spring.

17
00:02:09,196 --> 00:02:19,234
At the hospital, a patient could become infected on any ward, and the doctors were likely to count that as part of the treatment cost.

18
00:02:19,234 --> 00:02:30,596
The march of figures had already begun; today it was a page, yesterday it was a rumour, and the date of publication had been set for next month.

19
00:02:30,596 --> 00:02:40,991
A foot, a might, and a used prescription: the register wanted all three, and the club had none of them.
